### AtlasEcho Echoes (Posts/Memories) API Tests

### 1. Fetch all local echoes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/echoes?feed=local

### 2. Radius search echoes near Positano
GET http://localhost:3000/api/echoes?lat=40.6281&lng=14.4850&radius=10

### 3. Search echoes by keyword
GET http://localhost:3000/api/echoes?search=coffee

### 4. Fetch single echo by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/echoes/SOME_ECHO_ID

### 5. Drop new echo memory
POST http://localhost:3000/api/echoes
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Secret Grotto Overlook",
  "content": "Discovered a hidden stone archway looking over the cliffside.",
  "locationName": "Ravello, Italy",
  "latitude": 40.6489,
  "longitude": 14.6119,
  "weatherTemp": "76°F",
  "weatherCondition": "Clear",
  "weatherIcon": "sun",
  "tags": "#Cliffside #Ravello"
}

### 6. Toggle Like on Echo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/echoes/SOME_ECHO_ID/like
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
